        "code": "// Calls lineChart1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.lineChart1.clearClickedPoint();\nawait components.lineChart1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.lineChart1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.lineChart1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.lineChart1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.lineChart1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.lineChart1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.lineChart1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.lineChart1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.lineChart1.isDisabled, \"clickedDataPoint\": components.lineChart1.clickedDataPoint };",
